{"chapter":{"id":63,"nameSimple":"Al-Munafiqun","nameArabic":"المنافقون","translatedName":"The Hypocrites","versesCount":11,"revelationPlace":"madinah"},"verses":[{"id":5189,"verseKey":"63:1","verseNumber":1,"arabic":"إِذَا جَآءَكَ ٱلۡمُنَٰفِقُونَ قَالُواْ نَشۡهَدُ إِنَّكَ لَرَسُولُ ٱللَّهِۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَعۡلَمُ إِنَّكَ لَرَسُولُهُۥ وَٱللَّهُ يَشۡهَدُ إِنَّ ٱلۡمُنَٰفِقِينَ لَكَٰذِبُونَ","translation":"When the hypocrites come to you, [O Muḥammad], they say, \"We testify that you are the Messenger of Allāh.\" And Allāh knows that you are His Messenger, and Allāh testifies that the hypocrites are liars.","transliteration":"idhā jāaka l-munāfiqūna qālū nashhadu innaka larasūlu l-lahi wal-lahu yaʿlamu innaka larasūluhu wal-lahu yashhadu inna l-munāfiqīna lakādhibūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/063001.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,600],[1,2,610,2860],[2,3,2870,4500],[3,4,4510,5390],[4,5,5400,6200],[5,6,6210,7690],[6,7,7700,8940],[7,8,8950,9560],[8,9,9570,10600],[9,10,10610,11450],[10,11,11460,12760],[11,12,12770,14240],[12,13,14250,15240],[13,14,15250,16090],[14,15,16100,17450],[15,16,17460,19140],[16,17,19150,21920]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"إِذَا","translation":"When","transliteration":"idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"جَآءَكَ","translation":"come to you","transliteration":"jāaka"},{"position":3,"text":"ٱلۡمُنَٰفِقُونَ","translation":"the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqūna"},{"position":4,"text":"قَالُواْ","translation":"they say","transliteration":"qālū"},{"position":5,"text":"نَشۡهَدُ","translation":"We testify","transliteration":"nashhadu"},{"position":6,"text":"إِنَّكَ","translation":"that you","transliteration":"innaka"},{"position":7,"text":"لَرَسُولُ","translation":"(are) surely (the) Messenger","transliteration":"larasūlu"},{"position":8,"text":"ٱللَّهِۗ","translation":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi"},{"position":9,"text":"وَٱللَّهُ","translation":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu"},{"position":10,"text":"يَعۡلَمُ","translation":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu"},{"position":11,"text":"إِنَّكَ","translation":"that you","transliteration":"innaka"},{"position":12,"text":"لَرَسُولُهُۥ","translation":"(are) surely His Messenger","transliteration":"larasūluhu"},{"position":13,"text":"وَٱللَّهُ","translation":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu"},{"position":14,"text":"يَشۡهَدُ","translation":"testifies","transliteration":"yashhadu"},{"position":15,"text":"إِنَّ","translation":"that","transliteration":"inna"},{"position":16,"text":"ٱلۡمُنَٰفِقِينَ","translation":"the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna"},{"position":17,"text":"لَكَٰذِبُونَ","translation":"(are) surely liars","transliteration":"lakādhibūna"}]},{"id":5190,"verseKey":"63:2","verseNumber":2,"arabic":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓاْ أَيۡمَٰنَهُمۡ جُنَّةٗ فَصَدُّواْ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِۚ إِنَّهُمۡ سَآءَ مَا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","translation":"They have taken their oaths as a cover, so they averted [people] from the way of Allāh. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.","transliteration":"ittakhadhū aymānahum junnatan faṣaddū ʿan sabīli l-lahi innahum sāa mā kānū yaʿmalūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/063002.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,2480],[1,2,2490,3870],[2,3,3880,6480],[3,4,6490,7470],[4,5,7480,8510],[5,6,8520,9440],[6,7,9450,12350],[7,8,12360,14120],[8,9,14130,16320],[9,10,16330,16670],[10,11,16680,17630],[11,12,17640,20080]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓاْ","translation":"They take","transliteration":"ittakhadhū"},{"position":2,"text":"أَيۡمَٰنَهُمۡ","translation":"their oaths","transliteration":"aymānahum"},{"position":3,"text":"جُنَّةٗ","translation":"(as) a cover","transliteration":"junnatan"},{"position":4,"text":"فَصَدُّواْ","translation":"so they turn away","transliteration":"faṣaddū"},{"position":5,"text":"عَن","translation":"from","transliteration":"ʿan"},{"position":6,"text":"سَبِيلِ","translation":"(the) Way","transliteration":"sabīli"},{"position":7,"text":"ٱللَّهِۚ","translation":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi"},{"position":8,"text":"إِنَّهُمۡ","translation":"Indeed, [they]","transliteration":"innahum"},{"position":9,"text":"سَآءَ","translation":"evil is","transliteration":"sāa"},{"position":10,"text":"مَا","translation":"what","transliteration":"mā"},{"position":11,"text":"كَانُواْ","translation":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū"},{"position":12,"text":"يَعۡمَلُونَ","translation":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna"}]},{"id":5191,"verseKey":"63:3","verseNumber":3,"arabic":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمۡ ءَامَنُواْ ثُمَّ كَفَرُواْ فَطُبِعَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمۡ فَهُمۡ لَا يَفۡقَهُونَ","translation":"That is because they believed, and then they disbelieved; so their hearts were sealed over, and they do not understand.","transliteration":"dhālika bi-annahum āmanū thumma kafarū faṭubiʿa ʿalā qulūbihim fahum lā yafqahūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/063003.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,840],[1,2,850,3020],[2,3,3030,4040],[3,4,4050,5310],[4,5,5320,6110],[5,6,6120,6980],[6,7,6990,7590],[7,8,7600,8860],[8,9,8870,9530],[9,10,9540,9940],[10,11,9950,12680]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"ذَٰلِكَ","translation":"That","transliteration":"dhālika"},{"position":2,"text":"بِأَنَّهُمۡ","translation":"(is) because","transliteration":"bi-annahum"},{"position":3,"text":"ءَامَنُواْ","translation":"they believed","transliteration":"āmanū"},{"position":4,"text":"ثُمَّ","translation":"then","transliteration":"thumma"},{"position":5,"text":"كَفَرُواْ","translation":"they disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū"},{"position":6,"text":"فَطُبِعَ","translation":"so were sealed","transliteration":"faṭubiʿa"},{"position":7,"text":"عَلَىٰ","translation":"[upon]","transliteration":"ʿalā"},{"position":8,"text":"قُلُوبِهِمۡ","translation":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim"},{"position":9,"text":"فَهُمۡ","translation":"so they","transliteration":"fahum"},{"position":10,"text":"لَا","translation":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā"},{"position":11,"text":"يَفۡقَهُونَ","translation":"understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna"}]},{"id":5192,"verseKey":"63:4","verseNumber":4,"arabic":"۞ وَإِذَا رَأَيۡتَهُمۡ تُعۡجِبُكَ أَجۡسَامُهُمۡۖ وَإِن يَقُولُواْ تَسۡمَعۡ لِقَوۡلِهِمۡۖ كَأَنَّهُمۡ خُشُبٞ مُّسَنَّدَةٞۖ يَحۡسَبُونَ كُلَّ صَيۡحَةٍ عَلَيۡهِمۡۚ هُمُ ٱلۡعَدُوُّ فَٱحۡذَرۡهُمۡۚ قَٰتَلَهُمُ ٱللَّهُۖ أَنَّىٰ يُؤۡفَكُونَ","translation":"And when you see them, their forms please you, and if they speak, you listen to their speech. [They are] as if they were pieces of wood propped up - they think that every shout is against them. They are the enemy, so beware of them. May Allāh destroy them; how are they deluded?","transliteration":"wa-idhā ra-aytahum tuʿ'jibuka ajsāmuhum wa-in yaqūlū tasmaʿ liqawlihim ka-annahum khushubun musannadatun yaḥsabūna kulla ṣayḥatin ʿalayhim humu l-ʿaduwu fa-iḥ'dharhum qātalahumu l-lahu annā yu'fakūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/063004.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,760],[1,2,770,2010],[2,3,2020,3120],[3,4,3130,4990],[4,5,5000,6180],[5,6,6190,7040],[6,7,7050,7820],[7,8,7830,9510],[8,9,9520,11110],[9,10,11120,12640],[10,11,12650,15070],[11,12,15080,16220],[12,13,16230,16820],[13,14,16830,17870],[14,15,17880,19360],[15,16,19370,19750],[16,17,19760,20760],[17,18,20770,22430],[18,19,22440,23910],[19,20,23920,27490],[20,21,27500,28090],[21,22,28100,31080]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"۞ وَإِذَا","translation":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"رَأَيۡتَهُمۡ","translation":"you see them","transliteration":"ra-aytahum"},{"position":3,"text":"تُعۡجِبُكَ","translation":"pleases you","transliteration":"tuʿ'jibuka"},{"position":4,"text":"أَجۡسَامُهُمۡۖ","translation":"their bodies","transliteration":"ajsāmuhum"},{"position":5,"text":"وَإِن","translation":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in"},{"position":6,"text":"يَقُولُواْ","translation":"they speak","transliteration":"yaqūlū"},{"position":7,"text":"تَسۡمَعۡ","translation":"you listen","transliteration":"tasmaʿ"},{"position":8,"text":"لِقَوۡلِهِمۡۖ","translation":"to their speech","transliteration":"liqawlihim"},{"position":9,"text":"كَأَنَّهُمۡ","translation":"as if they (were)","transliteration":"ka-annahum"},{"position":10,"text":"خُشُبٞ","translation":"pieces of wood","transliteration":"khushubun"},{"position":11,"text":"مُّسَنَّدَةٞۖ","translation":"propped up","transliteration":"musannadatun"},{"position":12,"text":"يَحۡسَبُونَ","translation":"They think","transliteration":"yaḥsabūna"},{"position":13,"text":"كُلَّ","translation":"every","transliteration":"kulla"},{"position":14,"text":"صَيۡحَةٍ","translation":"shout","transliteration":"ṣayḥatin"},{"position":15,"text":"عَلَيۡهِمۡۚ","translation":"(is) against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim"},{"position":16,"text":"هُمُ","translation":"They","transliteration":"humu"},{"position":17,"text":"ٱلۡعَدُوُّ","translation":"(are) the enemy","transliteration":"l-ʿaduwu"},{"position":18,"text":"فَٱحۡذَرۡهُمۡۚ","translation":"so beware of them","transliteration":"fa-iḥ'dharhum"},{"position":19,"text":"قَٰتَلَهُمُ","translation":"May destroy them","transliteration":"qātalahumu"},{"position":20,"text":"ٱللَّهُۖ","translation":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu"},{"position":21,"text":"أَنَّىٰ","translation":"How","transliteration":"annā"},{"position":22,"text":"يُؤۡفَكُونَ","translation":"are they deluded","transliteration":"yu'fakūna"}]},{"id":5193,"verseKey":"63:5","verseNumber":5,"arabic":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمۡ تَعَالَوۡاْ يَسۡتَغۡفِرۡ لَكُمۡ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ لَوَّوۡاْ رُءُوسَهُمۡ وَرَأَيۡتَهُمۡ يَصُدُّونَ وَهُم مُّسۡتَكۡبِرُونَ","translation":"And when it is said to them, \"Come, the Messenger of Allāh will ask forgiveness for you,\" they turn their heads aside and you see them evading while they are arrogant.","transliteration":"wa-idhā qīla lahum taʿālaw yastaghfir lakum rasūlu l-lahi lawwaw ruūsahum wara-aytahum yaṣuddūna wahum mus'takbirūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/063005.mp3","segments":[[0,1,80,890],[1,2,900,1560],[2,3,1570,2070],[3,4,2080,3160],[4,5,3170,4300],[5,6,4310,4940],[6,7,4950,5790],[7,8,5800,6610],[8,9,6620,7400],[9,10,7410,11200],[10,11,11210,12600],[11,12,12610,13860],[12,13,13870,15360],[13,14,15370,18470]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَإِذَا","translation":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"قِيلَ","translation":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla"},{"position":3,"text":"لَهُمۡ","translation":"to them","transliteration":"lahum"},{"position":4,"text":"تَعَالَوۡاْ","translation":"Come","transliteration":"taʿālaw"},{"position":5,"text":"يَسۡتَغۡفِرۡ","translation":"will ask forgiveness","transliteration":"yastaghfir"},{"position":6,"text":"لَكُمۡ","translation":"for you","transliteration":"lakum"},{"position":7,"text":"رَسُولُ","translation":"(the) Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlu"},{"position":8,"text":"ٱللَّهِ","translation":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi"},{"position":9,"text":"لَوَّوۡاْ","translation":"They turn aside","transliteration":"lawwaw"},{"position":10,"text":"رُءُوسَهُمۡ","translation":"their heads","transliteration":"ruūsahum"},{"position":11,"text":"وَرَأَيۡتَهُمۡ","translation":"and you see them","transliteration":"wara-aytahum"},{"position":12,"text":"يَصُدُّونَ","translation":"turning away","transliteration":"yaṣuddūna"},{"position":13,"text":"وَهُم","translation":"while they","transliteration":"wahum"},{"position":14,"text":"مُّسۡتَكۡبِرُونَ","translation":"(are) arrogant","transliteration":"mus'takbirūna"}]},{"id":5194,"verseKey":"63:6","verseNumber":6,"arabic":"سَوَآءٌ عَلَيۡهِمۡ أَسۡتَغۡفَرۡتَ لَهُمۡ أَمۡ لَمۡ تَسۡتَغۡفِرۡ لَهُمۡ لَن يَغۡفِرَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمۡۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَهۡدِي ٱلۡقَوۡمَ ٱلۡفَٰسِقِينَ","translation":"It is all the same for them whether you ask forgiveness for them or do not ask forgiveness for them; never will Allāh forgive them. Indeed, Allāh does not guide the defiantly disobedient people.","transliteration":"sawāon ʿalayhim astaghfarta lahum am lam tastaghfir lahum lan yaghfira l-lahu lahum inna l-laha lā yahdī l-qawma l-fāsiqīna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/063006.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,2670],[1,2,2680,3760],[2,3,3770,5210],[3,4,5220,5830],[4,5,5840,6150],[5,6,6160,6580],[6,7,6590,7750],[7,8,7760,8420],[8,9,8430,9580],[9,10,9590,10460],[10,11,10470,11300],[11,12,11310,12440],[12,13,12450,13620],[13,14,13630,14470],[14,15,14480,14820],[15,16,14830,15500],[16,17,15510,16290],[17,18,16300,19640]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"سَوَآءٌ","translation":"(It) is same","transliteration":"sawāon"},{"position":2,"text":"عَلَيۡهِمۡ","translation":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim"},{"position":3,"text":"أَسۡتَغۡفَرۡتَ","translation":"whether you ask forgiveness","transliteration":"astaghfarta"},{"position":4,"text":"لَهُمۡ","translation":"for them","transliteration":"lahum"},{"position":5,"text":"أَمۡ","translation":"or","transliteration":"am"},{"position":6,"text":"لَمۡ","translation":"(do) not","transliteration":"lam"},{"position":7,"text":"تَسۡتَغۡفِرۡ","translation":"ask forgiveness","transliteration":"tastaghfir"},{"position":8,"text":"لَهُمۡ","translation":"for them","transliteration":"lahum"},{"position":9,"text":"لَن","translation":"Never","transliteration":"lan"},{"position":10,"text":"يَغۡفِرَ","translation":"will forgive","transliteration":"yaghfira"},{"position":11,"text":"ٱللَّهُ","translation":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu"},{"position":12,"text":"لَهُمۡۚ","translation":"[to] them","transliteration":"lahum"},{"position":13,"text":"إِنَّ","translation":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna"},{"position":14,"text":"ٱللَّهَ","translation":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha"},{"position":15,"text":"لَا","translation":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā"},{"position":16,"text":"يَهۡدِي","translation":"guide","transliteration":"yahdī"},{"position":17,"text":"ٱلۡقَوۡمَ","translation":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawma"},{"position":18,"text":"ٱلۡفَٰسِقِينَ","translation":"the defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna"}]},{"id":5195,"verseKey":"63:7","verseNumber":7,"arabic":"هُمُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَقُولُونَ لَا تُنفِقُواْ عَلَىٰ مَنۡ عِندَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ حَتّ